<Project>
  <!--
    Landing file for extra properties when this library's .slnx is built.
    MSBuild imports it from the directory that contains the solution file.

    Add PropertyGroups here after create if you want them out of the solution.
    Project-level SDK-close and analyzer config stay in the task-library csproj.

    The template does not emit properties into this file vs a project file with
    generate-time #if. Splitting them at create is theoretically possible and
    gets ugly fast. Move lines here by hand.
  -->
</Project>
